 "pdf": "ads114s06b.pdf",
 "pages": "p.4 (pins), p.6 (ROC), p.10 (timing), p.34 (Table 7), p.42-45 (reset, modes), p.46-47 (SPI, DRDY), p.48 (data format), p.49-53 (commands), p.54-67 (registers)",
 "notModeled": [
  "B revision (ads114s06b.pdf): the original ADS114S08 (ads114s06.pdf, SBAS815A, own spec file) also has the low-latency filter, programmable conversion delay, global chop, rail flags, STATUS byte / CRC output (SENDSTAT, CRC), direct data read without RDATA and AVSS-SW pin 28; those bits are reserved here",
  "analog input, PGA, multiplexer, reference, IDACs, bias voltage, burn-out sources, system monitors (stored only)",
  "GPIO0-3 on the analog pins (GPIODAT/GPIOCON stored only; the pins are analog in the model)",
  "offset / gain calibration commands and the OFCAL/FSCAL correction of the result",
  "conversion time is the first-data time of Table 7 (continuous and single-shot); second and later continuous conversions are 1 / data rate; internal 4.096 MHz oscillator (an external CLK scales it; the CLK pin is not used)",
  "WREG to 02h-07h or 09h[7:5] restarts an ongoing conversion and clears the data (datasheet); not modeled",
  "START/SYNC low stops continuous conversions only after the ongoing conversion completes; the START command is not decoded while START/SYNC is high",
  "in power-down only RREG, RDATA and WAKEUP work (all commands work in the model)",
  "commands are blocked during an RDATA / RREG reply and conversion data are not loaded during a register read (the model decodes bytes during replies)",
  "after RDATA the data bytes repeat with continued SCLK (modeled idle repeat; the same repeat follows an RREG reply, where the datasheet gives zeros past the last register)",
  "DRDY returns high at the first SCLK rising edge after it falls (modeled: on result read); 24 tCLK high pulse when data are not read",
  "DOUT/DRDY: the datasheet drives it low with DRDY only while CS is low and holds it Hi-Z with CS high",
  "RREG/WREG beyond the last register (zeros / ignored); SPI timeout (TIMEOUT bit); RDY flag and td(RSSC) 4096 tCLK reset delay; FL_REF monitor"
 ],
 "variants": "ADS114S06B / ADS114S08B share ads114s06b.pdf; ADS114S06B has 6 inputs (pins 19-22, 31, 32 without AIN6-AIN11), ADS114S08B 12. The original ADS114S06 / ADS114S08 (ads114s06.pdf) have their own spec files",
